    {
      "severity": "CONCERN",
      "title": "Per-worktree locks allow concurrent writes to the same run report",
      "description": "The lock is stored in each worktree\u2019s Git directory, so separate worktrees can run concurrently. But run state and reports default to the shared `~/.config/squadron/runs` directory (`src/squadron/pipeline/state.py:165-178`). Two item resumes for the same run from different worktrees can therefore both load and rewrite the same report, losing one update despite each holding its checkout\u2019s lock. Coordinate locks by shared run/report identity, or otherwise prevent concurrent resumes of the same run.",
